        "created_at": "2017-12-30T18:18:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Trajector\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/48/1914_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Trajector:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Is anybody else getting more and more put off by the Argent Adept as we learn more about his abilities? He seems to be WAY overpowered as a single combatant with abilities that do WAY too much at once, especially given how supporty, plinky, and self-comboy his deck is.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I feel that way more about Fanatic than anyone else.</p>",
