      {
        "id": 211615,
        "name": "Jeysie",
        "username": "Jeysie",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-12-30T18:28:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeeeeeeeah, I'm with Phantom5613.</p><p>On top of what I said above, it's been established that Argent's still very much&nbsp;<em>human</em>; there's been several instances that have made clear he's as physically vulnerable as a skinny guy who has no physical combat skills would be in any circumstance where his ability to wield his magic is curtailed somehow.</p><p>Meanwhile, I really don't see what about Fanatic's origins (even with all the info in her podcast) should make her capable of doing the increasing amount of literally godlike shenanigans she's been established as doing.</p>",
